e":"机甲骑士阿勒夫","type":"时装","sprite":{"sheet":"characters","name":"golem_rider_mechgolem"},"asset":{"key":"character:golem_rider_mechgolem","skin":null}},{"id":10343,"code":"golem_rider_madrobot","name":"疯狂熊猫阿勒夫","type":"时装","sprite":{"sheet":"characters","name":"golem_rider_madrobot"},"asset":{"key":"character:golem_rider_madrobot","skin":null}},{"id":10552,"code":"golem_rider_golem","name":"阿勒夫骑士魔像","type":"时装","sprite":{"sheet":"characters","name":"golem_rider_golem"},"asset":{"key":"character:golem_rider_golem","skin":null}}],"weapons":[{"code":"cwp_golemrider","name":"山神","type":"拳套","variants":[{"id":9070344,"code":"cwp_golemrider_epic","label":"普通","stars":5,"sprite":{"sheet":"items","name":"cwp_golemrider"},"stats":[{"name":"每秒伤害","values":[716,786],"baseValues":[716.0400000000001,786.2400000000001],"grows":true},{"name":"土属性攻击","values":[166,182],"baseValues":[165.75,182.00000000000003],"grows":true},{"name":"暴击率","values":[8,8],"unit":"%"},{"name":"防御","values":[27,30],"baseValues":[27.336000000000002,30.016000000000005],"grows":true}],"growthRate":1.02,"mainOptions":[{"name":"防御","min":10.0,"max":24.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":6.0,"max":16.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"技能伤害值","min":12.0,"max":24.0,"unit":"%"}],"subOptions":[{"name":"武器技能恢复速度","min":4.0,"max":12.0,"unit":"%"}],"subCount":[0,1],"limitBreak":[{"name":"攻击","min":10.0,"max":10.0,"unit":"%"}],"engrave":[{"name":"攻击","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"engraveRandom":[{"name":"生命","unit":"%","values":[3.0,6.0,9.0,12.0,15.0]}],"effects":[{"name":"专属效果","description":"命中目标时，以40%概率，按照每秒伤害的40%造成额外近程伤害。"}],"skill":{"name":"雷霆重击","description":"猛烈抨击地面3次，对前方敌人造成近程伤害并附带击飞效果。","levels":[1,5],"damage":[160.0,240.0],"cooldown":[9.2,8.0],"ailment":"击飞"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":[38],"Height":[143],"Weight":[38]},"tribes":["人类"],"story":"阿勒夫是擅长用木桩雕刻魔像的炼金术士。\n\n追求美丽的唯美主义者，其他人通常并不容易理解，但他对欣赏美丽有自己的一套“哲学”。他不仅欣赏外在美，而且还能分辨体现在外表上的内在美。阿勒夫拥有自己的“女神雷达”，无论外表多么美丽，若不能奏响雷达，就是拥有一颗丑陋的内心。当阿勒夫发现“真正的美丽”时，他会心甘情愿成为她的忠实仆人。\n\n外表稚嫩阿勒夫的实际年龄为38岁。阿勒夫曾听到有位女士说她讨厌大龄叔叔，为了变年轻，服用了自己炼制的返老还童灵丹，却因药效过猛，变成幼年模样。虽有办法挽救，但在看到女性对他的戒备心理有所缓解之后，毫不犹豫地选择以当前面貌生活。\n\n远离故乡阿勒夫的曾用名是阿勒夫奥德，他原是历代研究炼金术的世家子弟。头脑聪明，却游手好闲，整天跟着美女，着实让家人头疼。喜欢利用自己的一技之长，提炼宝石送给村里的姑娘们，当有人寻求帮助时，就用自己制造的魔像帮他们完成任务。当阿勒夫的国家与邻国爆发战争时，应王室的要求，雕刻出前所未有的超强白桦树魔像，并为保护国家做出了巨大贡献。他得知王室想借用魔像的威力试图发动另一场战争，便拒绝自己的魔像沦为战争武器，因此，被永远驱逐出境。他离开故乡时发誓要重新做人，便给自己起了一个新名字，即阿勒夫。","storyKey":"profile_golem_rider_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=356","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=356","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"],"voiceAudio":"gtaudio/data/offline-package.json; CharacterVoiceType; heroes.json VoiceId"},"voiceLines":[{"id":"golem_rider","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["再见，回归大地吧。"],"enUS":["Adios, go back to earth. "],"jaJP":["アディオス、土に帰れ"]},"keys":["cv_golem_rider_NormalBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/356/3560001@2393593632755771762"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/356/3560001"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/356/3560001@-195738397955938266"]},"audioName":"3560001"},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["你失败的原因很简单…因为你让美丽的女士生气了！"],"enUS":["There's a reason you lost. One simple reason… You angered the lady!"],"jaJP":["お前の敗因はたった一つ… レディーを怒らせたことだ！"]},"keys":["cv_golem_rider_BossBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/356/3560002@8521913531387213239"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/356/3560002"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/356/3560002@7427158679452458620"]},"audioName":"3560002"},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["呃…我不能让女士们看到我这副模样！"],"enUS":["This… I cannot let a lady see this…"],"jaJP":["こんな姿… レディーには見せられないな…"]},"keys":["cv_golem_rider_Die"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/356/3560003@2511053477022990756"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/356/3560003"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/356/3560003@-3866864092632329289"]},"audioName":"3560003"},{"type":"GetExp","label":"获得经验结晶","texts":{"zhCN":["嗯！不错！"],"enUS":["Umm! Great!"],"jaJP":["うむ！良いっ！"]},"keys":["cv_golem_rider_GetExp"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/356/3560004@-6238978987977130446"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/356/3560004"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/356/3560004@-7048808720485407600"]},"audioName":"3560004"},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["即使年纪大，还是觉得实力强是一件好事。"],"enUS":["It's nice to get stronger however much I get older. "],"jaJP":["たとえ歳を重ねても、強くなるのは嬉しいものさ"]},"keys":["cv_golem_rider_LevelUp"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/356/3560005@-8737410390452250608"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/356/3560005"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/356/3560005@-584444092313663039"]},"audioName":"3560005"},{"type":"EquipWeapon","label":"佩戴装备","texts":{"zhCN":["嗯？！魔像它好像很喜欢？"],"enUS":["Huh? The golem seems to like it. "],"jaJP":["おや？ゴーレムが喜んでいるな"]},"keys":["cv_golem_rider_EquipWeapon"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/356/3560006@2574607681921846557"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/356/3560006"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/356/3560006@-3577649726023132326"]},"audioName":"3560006"},{"type":"EquipCostume","label":"穿戴时装","texts":{"zhCN":["女士！等等我！我会变得更有魅力的～！"],"enUS":["Lady, wait for me! I'll return looking awesome!"],"jaJP":["しばしお待ちを、レディー！貴女の為に勝負服を用意いたしますのでね"]},"keys":["cv_golem_rider_EquipCostume"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/356/3560007@825475535802804417"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/356/35